      "url": "https://meridian-pay.atlassian.net/browse/PAY-157",
      "type": "Story",
      "status": "Done",
      "priority": "High",
      "summary": "Webhook delivery with retries",
      "description": "Deliver merchant webhooks with at-least-once semantics. On a non-2xx response or a 10 second timeout, retry up to 5 times with exponential backoff starting at 1 second (1s, 2s, 4s, 8s, 16s).\n\nAfter the final failure, mark the event failed and show it in the merchant dashboard.",
